# TourViable — environment variables
#
# Every source in lib/sources/* works without any key except Ticketmaster.
# Without the key, comparable-event/venue data falls back to a cited
# benchmark default (flagged as "Medium confidence" in the app) — the app
# is fully functional either way.

# Free tier, 5,000 requests/day: https://developer.ticketmaster.com/products-and-docs/apis/discovery-api/v2/
TICKETMASTER_API_KEY=
